  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-diagram-design",
      "text": "Diagram Design tools and gallery for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness): export HTML diagrams to SVG/PNG, import from draw.io / Mermaid / Excalidraw, validate output, and browse a gallery of 45 diagram types."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "| Tool | What it does |\n|---|---|\n| `diagram_export` | Export a diagram-design HTML file to a standalone SVG and/or PNG. |\n| `diagram_extract` | Parse a draw.io / Mermaid / Excalidraw file into a normalized digest for redrawing. |\n| `diagram_self_check` | Validate a generated diagram HTML file (accessible-SVG, single-file safety, viewBox). |\n| `diagram_doctor` | Diagnose the environment: bundled scripts, python3, Playwright availability. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "The gallery panel (sidebar \"Diagram Gallery\") lists the 45 diagram types with\nlive example previews."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin add github:Shang-ZZ/dsh-diagram-design\n```\n\nPNG export is the only feature that needs an extra dependency, installed once\non demand (never automatically):\n\n```bash\npip install playwright && playwright install chromium\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Attribution",
      "text": "The bundled Python scripts and example diagrams come from\n[`cathrynlavery/diagram-design`](https://github.com/cathrynlavery/diagram-design)\n(MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Cathryn Lavery). See [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
